&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of ML ecosystems, including models, use cases and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in setting up and optimizing distributed training pipelines across multi-node and multi-GPU environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on knowledge of frameworks like PyTorch or JAX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in deploying inference infrastructure for production workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to transition ML pipelines from POC to scalable production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
