&lt;li&gt;Ability to work autonomously and scope and effectively deliver projects across a variety of domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to analyse issues, identify causes, and recommend solutions quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills — with teams and customers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc or PhD in computer science, machine learning, applied statistics, mathematics, physics, engineering, software engineering, or a related field, with a record of experience in any of the following:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;scientific computing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;high-performance computing (CPU / GPU clusters);&lt;/li&gt;
